@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 4.3 — AI-Generated Prescriptive Report & LangGraph PES Agent

participant "AIAction\nPlanReport" as UI
participant "PrescriptiveReport\nController" as AC
participant "Metrics Calc\nService" as MCS
participant "AI Gateway\nService" as AIS
participant "FastAPI\nReport Service" as FRS
participant "Groq API" as Groq
participant "Prescriptive\nReport Service" as RBR

== Prescriptive Report Flow ==

UI -> AC: POST /api/v1/analytics/report\n{weeks: 4|8}
note right of UI
  Auto-fires on mount.
  Re-fires when weeks toggle changes.
  Shows spinner: "Analyzing your\ncampaign funnel..."
end note

AC -> AC: load default metrics(weeks)
AC -> MCS: computeFunnelTransitions(funnel)
note right of MCS
  Ranked by business impact (not raw drop %):
  Rank 1 — Clicks→Conversions (wasted ad spend)
  Rank 2 — Conversions→Bookings (abandoned leads)
  Rank 3 — Impressions→Clicks (expected CTR drop)
end note
MCS --> AC: List<FunnelTransition> (ranked)

AC -> AIS: generateReport(payload + funnelTransitions)
AIS -> FRS: POST /internal/report/generate

FRS -> FRS: resolvePlatform(marketKey)
note right of FRS
  recommendedPlatform resolved BEFORE
  LLM call (e.g. "Naver Blog" for Korea)
end note

FRS -> Groq: performance_report(rankedTransitions)
note right of Groq
  System prompt instructs:
  "Rank 1 = Weakest — do NOT re-order"
  Returns: executiveSummary, funnelDiagnostics[3],
  recommendations[3], recommendedPlatform
end note
Groq --> FRS: PrescriptiveReport
FRS --> AIS: PrescriptiveReport
AIS --> AC: PrescriptiveReport

AC --> UI: {executiveSummary, funnelDiagnostics,\nrecommendations, recommendedPlatform}
UI -> UI: Render Executive Summary
UI -> UI: Render Stage Analysis Panel\n[Most Urgent / Urgent / Not Very Urgent]
UI -> UI: Render 3 PriorityFixCards\n[Weakest / Moderate / Alright]

== FR4.26 Fallback ==

alt FastAPI unavailable
  AIS -> RBR: buildRuleBasedReport(metrics, transitions)
  note right of RBR
    1. Find metric with lowest PES contribution
    2. That metric = primary bottleneck stage
    3. Return 3 hardcoded contextual diagnostics
    No error propagated to frontend
  end note
  RBR --> AC: RuleBasedPrescriptiveReport
end

== PES Deep-Analysis Agent (LangGraph) ==

note over UI, Groq
  Backend-only (no UI trigger yet).
  POST /api/v1/analytics/pes-analysis triggers PesReportAgent:
  [generate_report] -> [evaluate_report] -> route_action
    • score >= 85 AND pass=true  → [finalize_response]
    • iterations >= 3 (MAX_RETRIES) → [finalize_response]
    • else → [generate_report] with evaluator feedback injected
  Output: {report_data: {metric_conditions, cross_metric_logic,
           ranked_weaknesses}, metadata: {final_score, total_iterations,
           needs_human_review}}
end note

@enduml
